comment.narrative:
This indicator comprises all infrastructure subprojects under Subcomponent 2.3, which will all be subject to climate-informed screening and design measures.

Conducted workshop for the infrastructure focals in RPIUS and FCUS: 
(1) Orientation of Infrastructure Project Implementation, including environmental and social-related concerns; 
(2) Conducted desk review/table evaluation for the proposed project sites; 
(3) On-going project scoping to assess and validate sites for the aquaculture and fisheries infrastructure subprojects.
